उ॑द्-अच् or 2. उ॑द्-अञ्च् (उद्- 2. अञ्च्), mf(ईची)n. turned or going upwards, upper, upwards (opposed to अधराञ्च्), RV. ii, 15, 6; x, 86, 22; ChUp. &c.;
 turned to the north, northern (opposed to दक्षिण), AV.; VS.; ŚBr.; Megh.; Ragh. &c.;
 subsequent, posterior, L.;
 (उदीची), f. (scil. दिश्) the northern quarter, the north;
 (2. उ॑दक्; for 1. see col. 1) ind. above;
 northward, RV.; VS.; ŚBr.; KātyŚr.; Mn. &c.;
 subsequently, L.

1. उद्-√ अञ्च् P. -अचति [Ved.] and -अञ्चति, to elevate, raise up, lift up, throw up, RV. v, 83, 8; VS.; ŚBr. &c.;
to ladle out, AV. Comm. on Pāṇ.;
to cause, effect, Prasannar.;
to rise, arise, Bālar.; Sāh.;
to resound, Rājat. :
Pass. -अच्यते, to be thrown out;
to come forth, proceed, BṛĀrUp. v, 1 :
Caus. -अञ्चयति, to draw up, raise, elevate, Daś.; Bālar.;
to send forth, utter, cause to resound (see उद्-अञ्चित).

